    "categoryId": "ability-lifecycle",
    "type": "single",
    "difficulty": "easy",
    "title": "在 UIAbility 中拿到 WindowStage 并加载页面内容，最应该从哪个回调开始处理？",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "a",
        "text": "onWindowStageCreate(windowStage)"
      },
      {
        "id": "b",
